{"1005180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sente", "steam_appid": 1005180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/dba75cb345a7b3b255a52acd4890db92.avif?t=1786456567\" alt=\"A new generation of simultaneous strategy\" width=616 height=74 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.poster.avif?t=1786456567\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.webm?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.mp4?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sente</strong> is a strategic board game where <strong>every player moves at the same time</strong>.  <br>Your victory isn’t about acting first; it’s about <strong>thinking ahead</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your nodes and build energy networks across the board. Then try to predict what your opponent will do, before they do it — because the moment you commit, so do they.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a network reaches an opponent's core, it triggers a critical overload. The chain reaction that follows can reshape the board in an instant, turning a small earlier decision into a turning point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous turns</strong> mean you're reading your opponent, not reacting to them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy networks and <strong>chain reactions</strong> can shift control of the board in a single move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic board layouts</strong> mean every match starts a little differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in board editor lets you design your own arenas and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay matches to review your tactics and plan your next approach</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the clarity of Chess and Go, Sente is built on a wholly original ruleset. There's no existing game to learn and no opening theory to memorise, every match begins on equal footing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/8f95c0f906b937e544c8ff323d056bbc.avif?t=1786456567\" alt=\"Play Solo or Against Friends\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/055b2ec62adf1734c7743c3271e2488f.poster.avif?t=1786456567\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/055b2ec62adf1734c7743c3271e2488f.webm?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/055b2ec62adf1734c7743c3271e2488f.mp4?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support for 1–6 players Sente has something for all types of strategy fan. Play solo in fully customisable battles or face off against human opponents in PvP! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo play</strong> - Challenge multiple levels of increasingly difficult AI opponents or jump into the narrative campaign. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online and local multiplayer - </strong>Compete with friends in 1v1 arenas, or head into Quick Play to take on the world! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-for-all or team-based strategy matches -</strong> Supporting 1-6 players, expect to not only change the battlefield, but also your strategy! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic puzzle challenges</strong> designed to sharpen your strategy as well as your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game mode adds new possibilities, and new unpredictable tactical battles for dominance where no two games are (likely) to be the same! Can a human mind still find the winning move when the odds are literally programmed against them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/07ec51a9fbba52c44f360ca206e9037e.avif?t=1786456567\" alt=\"Game Features\" width=616 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/638092c77ea21378e14a82b301beb977.poster.avif?t=1786456567\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/638092c77ea21378e14a82b301beb977.webm?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/638092c77ea21378e14a82b301beb977.mp4?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1–6 Player Strategic Showdowns - </strong>Face off on your own against AI, challenge friends locally, or compete online in tactical multiplayer matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous Mind Games - </strong>Everyone moves at once. Predict your opponents or watch your plans collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Disrupt Energy Networks - </strong>Expand across the board, cut enemy connections, and unleash explosive chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive Every Turning Point - </strong>Replay matches to analyse your victories and refine your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Design New Battlefields - </strong>Create custom boards and discover entirely new strategies with the in-game board editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Puzzle Challenges</strong> – Push your tactical thinking with curated scenarios designed to test your mastery.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Strategic Game Modes - </strong>Jump into quick matches, free-for-all clashes, or coordinated team battles, each mode reshaping how the board is played and the tactics you'll need to bring!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/dba75cb345a7b3b255a52acd4890db92.avif?t=1786456567\" alt=\"A new generation of simultaneous strategy\" width=616 height=74 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.poster.avif?t=1786456567\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.webm?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/f13d0ce370e8d4a2190eb71ecdcd0f51.mp4?t=1786456567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sente</strong> is a strategic board game where <strong>every player moves at the same time</strong>.  <br>Your victory isn’t about acting first; it’s about <strong>thinking ahead</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your nodes and build energy networks across the board. Then try to predict what your opponent will do, before they do it — because the moment you commit, so do they.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a network reaches an opponent's core, it triggers a critical overload. The chain reaction that follows can reshape the board in an instant, turning a small earlier decision into a turning point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous turns</strong> mean you're reading your opponent, not reacting to them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy networks and <strong>chain reactions</strong> can shift control of the board in a single move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic board layouts</strong> mean every match starts a little differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in board editor lets you design your own arenas and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay matches to review your tactics and plan your next approach</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the clarity of Chess and Go, Sente is built on a wholly original ruleset. There's no existing game to learn and no opening theory to memorise, every match begins on equal footing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1005180/extras/8f95c0f906b937e544c8ff323d056bbc.avif?t=1786456567\" alt=\"Play Solo or Against Friends\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn